Keep TensorStore's vendored PyPI repositories independent of Python's store path.

Bazel uses console_scripts_for_bazel, so omit pip's duplicate launchers and
installation records, which embed interpreter paths and script checksums.
Wheel download hashes and Bazel's entry points are unchanged.  Add regression
checks for host-path independence and preservation of headers and licenses.

